%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Welcome to the Eschaton Biotech International headquarters. How can I help you?
#
o_text: I'm looking for a job.
o_cond: !HasFlag('job_ebi1_accepted')
o_goto: LookingForJob
#
o_text: I've finished the distribution job.
o_cond: HasFlag('job_ebi1_accepted') && !HasFlag('job_ebi1_completed')
o_test: UserFunc('PAMPHLETS_DISTRIBUTED') > 0
o_succ: FinishedJob1
o_fail: NotFinishedJob1
#
o_text: Is there anything else I can do for you?
o_cond: HasFlag('job_ebi1_completed')
o_goto: LookingForJob2
#
o_text: I hear your campus has a visitor.
o_id: silence_ask
o_cond: !HasFlag('silence_accepted') && !HasFlag('job_ebi1_completed')
o_goto: SilenceOffer
#
o_text: The campus is quiet.
o_id: silence_report
o_cond: HasFlag('silence_accepted') && !HasFlag('silence_paid') && (HasFlag('ines_paid') || HasFlag('ines_moved') || HasFlag('Killed(protester_ines)'))
o_goto: SilencePaid
#
o_text: I have to go.
o_goto: Goodbye

name: Goodbye
npc: Goodbye.
#
effect: EndConversation

name: LookingForJob
npc: Deliver our EBI Pamphlets to the citizens of the city. You will be paid for each one you hand out or place on a bed.
#
o_text: I'll do it.
o_goto: AcceptJob1
#
o_text: I'm not interested.
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: AcceptJob1
npc: Perfect, take them from the brochure stand over there. Come back when you're done.
#
effect: SetFlag('job_ebi1_accepted')
#
o_text: Understood.
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: NotFinishedJob1
npc: You haven't finished the job yet.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: FinishedJob1
npc: Excellent work. Here's your payment.
#
effect: PlayerAddGold(UserFunc('PAMPHLETS_DISTRIBUTED') * 10)
effect: SetFlag('job_ebi1_completed')

name: LookingForJob2
npc: There is, as it happens.
#
o_text: Go on.
o_id: silence_go_on
o_goto: SilenceOffer

name: SilenceOffer
npc: A woman stands at our campus gate with a banner. The press has started to notice.
+ I want the campus quiet. 500 sat when it is. How is your business.
#
o_text: Consider it quiet.
o_id: silence_accept
o_goto: SilenceAccepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of work.
o_id: silence_decline
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: SilenceAccepted
npc: Good. I do not want to hear how.
effect: SetFlag('silence_accepted')
#
o_text: You won't.
o_id: silence_accepted_done
o_goto: Goodbye

name: SilencePaid
npc: (He checks a feed on his tablet, then nods once.) So it is. Five hundred.
effect: PlayerAddGold(500)
effect: SetFlag('silence_paid')
#
o_text: Pleasure.
o_id: silence_paid_done
o_goto: Goodbye
